                      "dcpa"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "no_quorum",
                    "status": "no",
                    "explanation": "The proposal passes only if at least 40% of eligible voters take part and more than half vote yes (or, when held with local elections, if yes-votes exceed half of the valid votes in the council election).",
